{"id":"47114eccf2042715","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-rpreserving.md","title":"Martin-Löf 随机性保持","display":"df-rpreserving — Martin-Löf 随机性保持","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-rpreserving"],"display":"df-rpreserving — Martin-Löf 随机性保持","label":"43-df-rpreserving","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-rpreserving</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rpreserving — Martin-Löf 随机性保持"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-rpreserving"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega\">\\(\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RPreserving}(\\Phi)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MLRandom}(\\Phi(X))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RPreserving}(\\Phi)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MLRandom}(\\Phi(X))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一般映射性质定义，不预设可计算性或测度保持性。定义本身为本地接口；不能用它推断映射有效。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RPreserving}(\\Phi)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{MLRandom}(\\Phi(X))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1094,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-rpreserving]] — Martin-Löf 随机性保持"},{"id":"ea0e84ad87980968","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$，$\\mu$、$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间；相关谓词见 [[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]、[[43-df-rpreserving]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。"},{"id":"73b611f2b292e511","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{RPreserving}$、$\\operatorname{MLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-rpreserving]]、[[43-df-mltest]]。U与V遍历开集序列。"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605"]}